{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>iKana 是一款專為日語初學者而設的假名學習 App，透過閃卡、母語者發音示範與多款測驗，協助使用者掌握平假名與片假名的讀音及筆順。無論是準備日語考試的學生，還是希望由零開始自學日語的上班族，都適合使用。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>閃卡測驗同步練讀寫</h2>\n<p>閃卡可隨時開關羅馬拼音並顯示筆順動畫，讓你在螢幕上反覆書寫每個假名，並由日本母語者示範發音。四款測驗分別訓練速讀配對、筆順描寫、以假名補全詞彙及聽音辨字，有助提升閱讀與聽寫能力。初學者字典收錄數百個常用詞，可按假名、羅馬拼音或英文釋義搜尋並聆聽讀音。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1125x2436bb-5.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：iKana – Hiragana and Katakana</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T05:38:15.089683+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}